@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ==========================================================================
### 0. FULL CRUD ENDPOINTS (PAGINATION ONLY - BUN, .NET, & LARAVEL PARITY)
### ==========================================================================

### 0.1 Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 0.2 Categories - List All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 0.3 Categories - Create Category
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamera & Fotografi",
  "slug": "kamera-fotografi"
}

### 0.4 Categories - Get Category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.data.id}}

### 0.5 Categories - Update Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamera, Lensa & Fotografi",
  "slug": "kamera-lensa-fotografi"
}

### 0.6 Categories - Delete Category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.data.id}}

### 0.7 Products - List (Page 1, Limit 10, Pagination Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&limit=10

### 0.8 Products - List (Page 2, Limit 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=2&limit=20

### 0.9 Products - Create Product
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony Alpha A7 IV Mirrorless",
  "price": 34999000.00
}

### 0.10 Products - Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}

### 0.11 Products - Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony Alpha A7 IV Mirrorless Body Only (Promo)",
  "price": 32999000.00
}

### 0.12 Products - Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}

### ==========================================================================
### 1. PENCARIAN STANDAR & PAGINASI (500.000 DATA)
### ==========================================================================

### 1.1 Halaman Pertama (Page 1, 10 Items, Default Sort by createdAt DESC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 1.2 Deep Pagination (Page 50, Limit 20 dengan Sort Harga Tertinggi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 50,
    "limit": 20
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 2. FILTER RELASI KATEGORI (CATEGORY FILTERING)
### ==========================================================================

### 2.1 Filter Single Kategori via Slug ("gadget-smartphone")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "category.slug", "operator": "eq", "value": "gadget-smartphone" }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "asc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 2.2 Filter Multi-Kategori dengan Operator `in`
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "in",
        "value": ["laptop-komputer", "gadget-smartphone", "elektronik-rumah"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "category.name", "order": "asc" },
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 15
  }
}

### 2.3 Exclude Kategori Tertentu dengan Operator `not_in`
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "not_in",
        "value": ["makanan-minuman", "otomotif-aksesoris"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 3. FILTER RANGE HARGA (PRICE RANGE)
### ==========================================================================

### 3.1 Range Harga Produk Terjangkau (Rp 50.000 s/d Rp 250.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "AND",
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "price", "operator": "gte", "value": 50000 },
      { "field": "price", "operator": "lte", "value": 250000 }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "asc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 3.2 Produk Premium / High-End (> Rp 15.000.000) di Kategori Laptop & Gadget
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "AND",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "in",
        "value": ["laptop-komputer", "gadget-smartphone"]
      },
      { "field": "price", "operator": "gte", "value": 15000000 }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 4. PENCARIAN NAMA PRODUK (TEXT SEARCH / ILIKE)
### ==========================================================================

### 4.1 Pencarian Kata Kunci "Samsung Galaxy"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Samsung Galaxy" }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 4.2 Pencarian Multi-Keyword OR ("Asus ROG" ATAU "Lenovo Legion")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Asus ROG" },
      { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Lenovo Legion" }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "asc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 4.3 Pencarian Cepat via GET dengan Query Parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?page=1&limit=5&search=Galaxy&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc


### ==========================================================================
### 5. NESTED FILTER LOGIC KOMPLEKS (AND + OR KOMBINASI)
### ==========================================================================

### 5.1 Buku Pelajaran / Edukasi dengan Topik Tertentu dan Batas Harga
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "AND",
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "category.slug", "operator": "eq", "value": "buku-pelajaran" },
      { "field": "price", "operator": "lte", "value": 150000 },
      {
        "logic": "OR",
        "conditions": [
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Matematika" },
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Fisika" },
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Kurikulum Merdeka" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "category.name", "order": "asc" },
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### 5.2 Fashion & Sepatu: Pakaian Pria ATAU Sepatu Sandal dengan Merek Populer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "AND",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "in",
        "value": ["pakaian-pria", "sepatu-sandal"]
      },
      { "field": "price", "operator": "lte", "value": 1000000 },
      {
        "logic": "OR",
        "conditions": [
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Nike" },
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Adidas" },
          { "field": "name", "operator": "ilike", "value": "Uniqlo" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "price", "order": "asc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 6. FILTER WAKTU (DATE RANGE CREATED_AT)
### ==========================================================================

### 6.1 Produk yang Dibuat dalam Rentang Tanggal Tertentu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "logic": "AND",
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "createdAt", "operator": "gte", "value": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z" },
      { "field": "createdAt", "operator": "lte", "value": "2026-06-30T23:59:59.999Z" }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "createdAt", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 7. MULTI-COLUMN SORTING
### ==========================================================================

### 7.1 Sort Nama Kategori (ASC), lalu Harga (DESC), lalu Tanggal Dibuat (DESC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "in",
        "value": ["makanan-minuman", "olahraga-outdoor", "kecantikan-perawatan"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sort": [
    { "field": "category.name", "order": "asc" },
    { "field": "price", "order": "desc" },
    { "field": "createdAt", "order": "desc" }
  ],
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 12
  }
}


### ==========================================================================
### 8. ERROR HANDLING & SECURITY TESTS (SECURITY & VALIDATION)
### ==========================================================================

### 8.1 Percobaan Akses Kolom Tidak Terdaftar (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "password_hash", "operator": "eq", "value": "secret" }
    ]
  }
}

### 8.2 Percobaan Sort Kolom Tidak Terdaftar (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sort": [
    { "field": "internal_token", "order": "asc" }
  ]
}

### 8.3 Operator Tidak Didukung (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "name", "operator": "regex_match", "value": "^[a-z]" }
    ]
  }
}

### 8.4 Endpoint Not Found (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unsupported-endpoint

### 8.5 Method Not Allowed (Expected: 405 Method Not Allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 8.6 Format Tanggal Tidak Valid (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      { "field": "createdAt", "operator": "gte", "value": "bukan-tanggal-valid" }
    ]
  }
}

### 8.7 Payload Kosong / Empty Body (Expected: 200 OK dengan Paginasi Default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json


### ==========================================================================
### 9. GENERIC GROUPING (ADMIN PANEL GROUPED TABLE)
### ==========================================================================

### 9.1 Grouping Berdasarkan Kategori dengan groupLabel, groupMeta, dan items: []
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "category.slug",
        "operator": "in",
        "value": ["laptop-komputer", "gadget-smartphone", "buku-pelajaran"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "groupBy": {
    "field": "category.id",
    "labelField": "category.name",
    "metaFields": ["category.slug"]
  },
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 15
  }
}

### 9.2 Direct Admin Filter Menggunakan categoryId Langsung (Tanpa Relasi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "conditions": [
      {
        "field": "categoryId",
        "operator": "is_not_null"
      },
      {
        "field": "price",
        "operator": "lte",
        "value": 500000
      }
    ]
  },
  "groupBy": {
    "field": "price",
    "labelField": "category.name"
  },
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10
  }
}

### ==========================================================================
### 10. CATEGORIES ENDPOINT (FOR ADMIN PANEL DROPDOWN / SELECT)
### ==========================================================================

### 10.1 Ambil Semua Kategori (Untuk Mengisi Select Option di Admin Frontend)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 9.3 Grouping Berdasarkan Tanggal/Timestamp (dateTrunc: "month" atau "day")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupBy": {
    "field": "createdAt",
    "dateTrunc": "month"
  },
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 15
  }
}

### 9.4 Grouping Berdasarkan Range Integer / Angka (numberBucket: 5000000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupBy": {
    "field": "price",
    "numberBucket": 5000000
  },
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 15
  }
}

### ==========================================================================
### 11. BENCHMARK DEDICATED ENDPOINTS (BUN vs .NET 10)
### ==========================================================================

### 11.1 Healthcheck & Memory Baseline
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 11.2 Case 1: Filtering & Sorting (Price Range + Order by price desc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark/filter-sort?minPrice=50000&maxPrice=500000&limit=20

### 11.3 Case 2: Deep Pagination (Offset stress)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark/pagination-deep?page=500&limit=20

### 11.4 Case 3: Searching (ILIKE Pattern Match on 500k rows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark/search-text?q=Galaxy&limit=20

### 11.5 Case 4: Grouping & Aggregation (Category stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark/group-aggregate

### 11.6 Case 5: CPU Compute & Heavy JSON Serialization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark/cpu-json?limit=200

